sequenceDiagram
  participant scanner as Minute scanner
  participant db as MariaDB transaction
  participant transport as Simulated receiver
  participant human as Coordinator
  scanner->>db: Insert unique due event key
  scanner->>db: Lock due pending row
  scanner->>transport: Attempt delivery with event ID
  transport->>db: Success insert unique receipt
  scanner->>db: Commit receipt state and audit together
  transport-->>scanner: Alternative failure outcome transient or permanent
  scanner->>db: Retain retry with backoff or manual review
  human->>db: Record human handling without resend
